[PrintTextModified Text:看守正在打扫二阶堂希罗的尸体。<br>在此作业期间——|#0101Adv05_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Fearful1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmR2,ArmL4

