[PrintTextModified Text:有一位难耐恐惧的少女<br>猛然开始狂奔。|#0101Adv05_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Jailer.1

[PrintTextModified Text:看守对逃跑行动作出了反应。<br>它开始以迅猛之势追赶那位少女，紫藤亚里沙。|#0101Adv05_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:（危险！）|#0101Adv05_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Jailer.1 SubId:Middle
@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Jailer-Middle Loop:false ScenePositionX:15 ScenePositionY:8 Scale:1.4

[PrintTextModified Text:跟在亚里沙身后的看守，手上的镰刀亮起寒光。|#0101Adv05_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:面对即将二度降临的悲剧，<br>大部分少女都捂住了眼睛，发出了惊叫声。|#0101Adv05_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Angry1

