[PrintTextModified Text:等一下！|#0101Adv05_Leia001| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一位少女用威严的声音说道。<br>在场的所有人都回过神来看着她。|#0101Adv05_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那位少女——莲见蕾雅<br>拔出了腰间的刺剑，站到亚里沙和看守二位中间。|#0101Adv05_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不许对她出手！<br>我不会再让悲剧发生！|#0101Adv05_Leia002| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:15 IdAndAppearance:Jailer.1 SubId:Middle
