[PrintTextModified Text:看守似乎没有听进去，<br>继续用力挥下镰刀。|#0101Adv05_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_9 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

