; ＠備考◆跳躍の気合声

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:——哈！|#0101Adv05_Leia003| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_178 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅瞬间往后方跳去，<br>让看守砍了个空。|#0101Adv05_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Angry1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Surprised1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmR2,ArmL4

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅保持着握剑姿势，<br>以坚决的眼神直视看守。|#0101Adv05_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她没有违反规定。<br>你没有理由杀她。|#0101Adv05_Leia004| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在蕾雅身后站着的亚里沙<br>大概是丧失了逃跑的欲望，呆站在原地一动不动。|#0101Adv05_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你为什么……|#0101Adv05_Alisa002| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我想保护你们。<br>所以，我们大家都应该冷静下来。|#0101Adv05_Leia005| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Jailer.1

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0101Adv05_Jailer002| AuthorId:Jailer RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:看守不再挥动镰刀，回到了原先的打扫作业中。<br>或许，刚才的行动只是出于警告目的。|#0101Adv05_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:接着，它扛起希罗的尸体离开了房间。|#0101Adv05_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_5_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:随着看守的离开，<br>少女之间紧绷的气氛终于有了稍许缓解。|#0101Adv05_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:只不过，尽管希罗的尸体已打扫干净，<br>但室内仍充满着沉闷的血液气味。|#0101Adv05_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:刚刚有人说过，<br>这个房间【很臭】。|#0101Adv05_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:会客厅装点着恶趣味装饰，散发着邪气。|#0101Adv05_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果说，这里的绒毯、沙发、窗帘，每样东西都在长年累月间<br>吮吸着少女们的鲜血——|#0101Adv05_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Fearful1,ArmL8
@EmoteNod ActorIds:Coco Loop:false Speed:1

[PrintTextModified Text:呜，呕呕呕……|#0101Adv05_Coco001| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:一想到这些或许就是事实，可可便吐了出来。|#0101Adv05_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:到现在都没人想吐，这才是怪事。<br>现在的状况，就是如此地脱离常轨。|#0101Adv05_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这时有人站到了中间。<br>不用多想，那就是蕾雅。|#0101Adv05_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:大家，请听我说！|#0101Adv05_Leia006| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看来，我们被迫只能在这里共同生活了。<br>虽然不知道要待到什么时候……<br>现在我们还是乖乖照做吧。|#0101Adv05_Leia007| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:尽管我们才刚认识不久，<br>但是我想尽量保护你们。|#0101Adv05_Leia008| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:像刚才希罗作出的举动，<br>还有像亚里沙刚才那样的逃跑行为，<br>有可能会危及我们所有人。|#0101Adv05_Leia009| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我希望大家今后可以谨慎行动。|#0101Adv05_Leia010| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmR2,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:啧……|#0101Adv05_Alisa003| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙无法反驳，<br>只好咂了咂舌宣泄不满。|#0101Adv05_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:……首先，请大家看一下自己的口袋。<br>应该每个人都发了一部手机。|#0101Adv05_Leia011| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:听蕾雅这么讲，<br>所有人都摸了摸自己的口袋。|#0101Adv05_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（真的欸……虽然不是我自己的，<br>　不过确实有一部智能手机……<br>　难道可以用它联络外界！？）|#0101Adv05_Ema003|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:遗憾的是，没有信号，<br>不能用来和外界联络。|#0101Adv05_Leia012| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们是被抓来这个地方的，<br>有信号才奇怪……|#0101Adv05_Leia013| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:希望瞬间破灭，<br>艾玛失望地垂下肩膀。|#0101Adv05_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在手机里面，<br>有一个叫【魔女图鉴】的APP。|#0101Adv05_Leia014| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:刚才典狱长也讲了，<br>【魔女图鉴】好像就是规则手册。<br>里面收录了监牢的地图和规定，还有我们囚犯的资料。|#0101Adv05_Leia015| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:请大家都认真去看【魔女图鉴】里面<br>记录的规定，一起生活下去吧。|#0101Adv05_Leia016| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

