@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmR2,ArmL7

[PrintTextModified Text:……开什么玩笑！<br>我才不管什么规定不规定！|#0101Adv05_Alisa004| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:什么魔女什么囚犯都见鬼去吧！<br>我一秒都不想待在这个地方。<br>我要离开这里！|#0101Adv05_Alisa005| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:面对咬牙切齿的亚里沙，<br>蕾雅忧愁地叹了口气。|#0101Adv05_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1,ArmR5

[PrintTextModified Text:你要是再表现出反抗的态度，<br>我可不知道看守会对你做出什么事来。|#0101Adv05_Leia017| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:跟你没关系吧，你管我！|#0101Adv05_Alisa006| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙咂了咂舌，离开了会客厅。<br>蕾雅无可奈何地耸了耸肩。|#0101Adv05_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:除了她，剩下来的人应该可以好好配合吧？|#0101Adv05_Leia018| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Determined2,ArmR3,ArmL7

[PrintTextModified Text:……我也，不愿意。|#0101Adv05_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛往前走出一步，开口说道。|#0101Adv05_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我才不要听，杀死希罗的<br>那帮家伙讲的话！<br>我绝对不会原谅它们！|#0101Adv05_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:双眼闪着泪花的艾玛坚定说道。<br>蕾雅露出了有些惊讶的表情。|#0101Adv05_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:是这样啊。<br>你好像认识希罗，对吗。|#0101Adv05_Leia019| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不过在我看来，你们好像关系并不是很好？|#0101Adv05_Leia020| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3,ArmL7

[PrintTextModified Text:因为，希罗她……<br>希罗她是一个正直的人……|#0101Adv05_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1,ArmR5

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅轻轻叹了口气。|#0101Adv05_Narrative032| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:唉，我知道你不打算遵守了。<br>我也不会强迫你。|#0101Adv05_Leia021| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不过，我希望大家可以温和一些。<br>我们无法和引来危险的分子一起行动。|#0101Adv05_Leia022| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmL6
@EmoteJumpDouble ActorIds:Sherry Loop:false Speed:1

[PrintTextModified Text:我也来我也来！<br>我也要选艾玛这边～！|#0101Adv05_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉兴奋地举起了手。|#0101Adv05_Narrative033| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛惊讶得张大了双眼，<br>事情的发展超出了她的预料。|#0101Adv05_Narrative034| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmL8

[PrintTextModified Text:选边就要选有趣的一边，这就是我的信条！|#0101Adv05_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR13,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:而艾玛你！<br>我从你的身上闻到了一股超浓郁的有趣味道！|#0101Adv05_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR3,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:浓郁的，味道……？|#0101Adv05_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不知何时，艾玛的身边<br>又多了汉娜和梅露露两个人。|#0101Adv05_Narrative035| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:我也要和你站一边。<br>本小姐最讨厌那种一副大人物的样子指指点点的人了。|#0101Adv05_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看样子，她并没有想着支持艾玛，<br>而只是单纯地看不惯蕾雅。<br>似乎自尊受伤一事令她十分介怀。|#0101Adv05_Narrative036| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:呜呜……艾玛小姐……|#0101Adv05_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而梅露露好像有点怕生，<br>她紧紧贴住了艾玛。|#0101Adv05_Narrative037| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL11

[PrintTextModified Text:哎呀呀～？<br>意见分成两派了耶。|#0101Adv05_Sherry004| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1,ArmR5

[PrintTextModified Text:……看来的确如此。|#0101Adv05_Leia023| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:大家能齐心协力度过难关那就最好，<br>不过意见不合就没办法了。|#0101Adv05_Leia024| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们先回地下去吧。<br>根据规定，现在是必须待在地下牢房内的时间。|#0101Adv05_Leia025| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅动身后，<br>决定和她坐同一条船的少女们<br>也都跟在她身后离开了。|#0101Adv05_Narrative038| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:留在会客厅内的，<br>就只剩艾玛、雪莉、汉娜和梅露露4个人。|#0101Adv05_Narrative039| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL1
@EmoteJumpDouble ActorIds:Sherry Loop:false Speed:1

[PrintTextModified Text:然后呢然后呢？？我们接下来做什么？<br>大家齐心协力去弄死看守？|#0101Adv05_Sherry005| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR1,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:不、不可以啦。<br>会像希罗那样被杀死的。|#0101Adv05_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:"（不能原谅杀死希罗的看守，还有典狱长……<br>　可是……）|#0101Adv05_Ema009|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（不多加考虑冲动行事，只会落得同样的下场。<br>　我一定要冷静行动）|#0101Adv05_Ema010|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:……总之，我们先回地下去吧。<br>我们也应该看一下规定才对。|#0101Adv05_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

